# --max-arg-length: lint-staged auto-detects Windows' 8191-char cmd.exe
# limit already, but that doesn't leave headroom for the extra quoting
# Windows adds around paths with brackets (this repo's Next.js dynamic
# routes, e.g. events/[eventId]/...) — found live, on the first real
# commit this hook ran against (170+ staged files): "prettier --write:
# The command line is too long" even with auto-chunking. A firm, lower
# cap forces smaller chunks with real headroom instead of cutting it
# exactly at the OS ceiling.
npx lint-staged --max-arg-length=4000
